# WRAPPER IS NOW COMMITTED (2026-08-14). This used to be `/android/gradle*`, which hid the
# Gradle wrapper, so CI built with whatever Gradle the runner image happened to ship. That
# drifted below Flutter's minimum and broke the first build in three weeks. Gradle's own
# guidance is to commit the wrapper; only the build cache stays ignored.
/android/.gradle/
/android/local.properties
/android/app/google-services.json

